    "section_text_UDwpTQ": {
      "type": "section-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_iXiXbn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Shipping Policy:</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_Gny9aV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>BLACK LIST Member Shipping Benefits</h3><p>Join the <strong>BLACK LIST</strong> and enjoy exclusive shipping benefits:</p><ul><li><strong>Your first order ships free.</strong> No minimum purchase required.</li><li><strong>Every order of $75 or more ships free.</strong> An exclusive benefit for BLACK LIST members.</li></ul><p>No fees. No points. Just member benefits.</p><p>Free shipping benefits apply to eligible orders shipped within the 48 contiguous United States. Standard shipping rates apply to orders that do not qualify for free shipping.</p><h3></h3><h3>Processing & Delivery</h3><p>Orders are typically processed within 1–2 business days. During the holiday season, please allow 5–7 business days for processing.</p><p>Most orders ship via FedEx or UPS Home Delivery. Smaller items, such as replacement covers and accessories, may ship via USPS.</p><p>Once your order leaves our warehouse, you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information.</p><p>All orders ship from Minneapolis, Minnesota. Estimated transit times vary by destination:</p><ul><li><strong>West Coast:</strong> 4–5 business days</li><li><strong>Central U.S.:</strong> 2–3 business days</li><li><strong>East Coast:</strong> 3–4 business days</li></ul><p>These are estimated transit times after processing and are not guaranteed.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "text_Vxyznp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Missing or Lost Packages</h3><p>If your tracking information shows that your package was delivered but you haven't received it, please check around your property and with your neighbors.</p><p>Occasionally, carriers mark packages as delivered before they arrive. We recommend allowing 24 hours after the reported delivery time before contacting us.</p><p>If your package still hasn't arrived, please contact us so we can initiate a trace with the carrier.</p><ul><li>Carrier traces typically take approximately 2 business days and must be completed before we can proceed with lost-package procedures.</li><li>You must contact us within 5 days of the reported delivery date to initiate a trace.</li><li>If a missing package is not reported within 5 days, we may be unable to initiate a carrier trace, and a replacement will count toward your warranty replacement.</li><li>Packages reported missing more than 2 weeks after the reported delivery date are not eligible for replacement.</li></ul><h3>Shipping Restrictions</h3><p>We currently ship only within the 48 contiguous United States.</p><p>For Alaska, Hawaii, U.S. territories, APO/FPO addresses, and international destinations, you may consider using a package-forwarding service such as reship.com.</p><p></p><p><strong>We do not ship to P.O. boxes.</strong></p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "text_8mHpL4": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Traces take an average of 2 business days to complete and must be completed before we can proceed with lost package procedures. You must contact us within 5 days of the order being marked as delivered in order for us to start a trace. If you do not contact us within that timeframe, we will not be able to do a trace and the replacement will count as your warranty replacement. Packages reported as lost two weeks past the delivery date are not eligible for replacement.</p><p>Please note that we currently do not ship outside the 48 contiguous continental United States. For Alaska, Hawaii, US territories, FPO/APO and international addresses, please consider a forwarding service like reship.com to have the order delivered to you.</p><p>- We DO NOT ship to PO Box's</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "heading_LzCxzY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Order Changes:</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_c7bq8k": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Once an order is placed it is not possible for us to modify the items on the order in any way. This includes changing the size, color, quantity of existing items, removing or adding products, or adding embroidery. However, if the order has not yet shipped, we may be able to cancel the order so that you may place a new one that includes the desired changes. If you need to make a change, please contact us immediately via phone during business hours to see if we can cancel the current order for you.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "heading_8JTKp3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Shipping Address Changes:</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_H8jGEn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Please double-check your shipping address before completing your purchase. If you use PayPal, Google Pay, Shop Pay, or another accelerated checkout service, make sure your saved shipping information is accurate.</p><p>Because orders move quickly through our fulfillment process, we cannot guarantee address changes after an order is placed.</p><p><strong>Before shipment:</strong> We may be able to update your address before your order is packed and a shipping label is generated.</p><p><strong>After shipment:</strong> If your package ships via UPS or FedEx, we may be able to request an address correction through the carrier.</p><p>UPS and FedEx charge a <strong>$17 address correction fee</strong> for changes such as correcting a street address, adding an apartment number, or redirecting a package. This fee is the customer's responsibility when a correction is requested after the shipping label has been created.</p><p>Alternatively, you may contact the carrier to request that your package be held for pickup:</p><ul><li><strong>FedEx:</strong> 800-463-3339</li><li><strong>UPS:</strong> 800-742-5877</li></ul><p>UPS pickup requests may also be available through your tracking page.</p><p>Please note that address changes cannot be made once a package is out for delivery. USPS shipping addresses cannot be modified once a package is in transit.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "text_fP8XYM": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We can make changes to the shipping address on an order up until the item is packed and a shipping label generated. After that, the handling of the package is no longer under our control. If the package shipped via UPS or FedEx, we can contact the carrier to update the shipping address of a package that is in transit. Both carriers charge us a $17 flat fee for any address corrections, including fixing misspellings, adding apartment numbers, or changing the address completely. Due to this, any shipping address changes made after the shipping label is created will require a $17 payment from the customer to cover the carrier’s fees.</p><p>If you have misspelled the street address or forgot to add an apartment number, you can contact FedEx at 800-463-3339 or UPS at 800-742-5877 and request to have the package held for pickup instead of updating the address (for UPS, you can also do this online from the tracking information page).</p><p>Please note that once an item is out for delivery, no changes can be made to the address. The addresses for items shipped via USPS cannot be modified at all once in transit.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "text_tAX4db": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Digital warranties cannot be used for gift card purchases</strong>, and warranties are applicable only to items purchased directly from Black Lab.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "heading_hg37kB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Order Cancellation:&nbsp;</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_jpeHyG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We process and ship orders quickly, so we cannot guarantee cancellation once an order has been placed.</p><p>If you need to cancel an order, please contact us as soon as possible by phone during business hours or through our support form.</p><p>Once a tracking number has been issued, the order can no longer be canceled.</p><p>Orders containing customizations cannot be canceled or refunded once customization work has begun.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "text_4pQUJ9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If your order contains items with embroidery or other customizations, we cannot cancel or refund the order if the customization has already been started or completed.</p><p>At Black Lab Brands, we take pride in offering the highest-quality, eco-friendly products for your pup. If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact us. We're always here<br/>to help!</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        },
        "heading_KKKBnB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Warranty & Gift Cards:&nbsp;</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "heading_highlight_type": "italics",
            "highlight_color": "#d43747",
            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_nePVmq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Digital warranties cannot be applied toward gift card purchases. Warranties are valid only for eligible products purchased directly from Black Lab Brands.</p><h4></h4><h4>Questions?</h4><p>We're committed to making your experience with Black Lab Brands as straightforward as possible. If you have questions about your order, shipping, or delivery, please contact our customer support team. We're happy to help.</p>",
            "size": 100
          }
        }
      },
